  "details": "U,I,O,J,K and L are used by desktop players to rotate objects they are holding. Teleporting the player either using TeleportTo in an udon script, or through a menu respawn will break this control. \nYou can replicate this in any world where there is a pickup. Test the pickup and rotate it. The rotation works. Now teleport either by respawning or by interacting with an object with a TeleportTo script, such as a door. Now when you go to rotate the pickup, the uiojkl keys will not rotate the object.\nsdk3 2021-01-28",
